# Architecture

- Layers: `app` routes → feature components → hooks/contexts/util/constants
- Shared chrome: Form, Header, Footer, Protected, Skeleton
- Auth via `AuthProvider` / Cognito; data via SWR + build-time `public/data`
- Sibling API / Lambda / Authorizer repos stay out of tree
- See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
